{"ref":"BDB, מָדוֹן","hw":"מָדוֹן","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מָדוֹן</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.10\">Pr 22:10</a></sup> <strong>strife, contention</strong>—<a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:7\" href=\"/Psalms.80.7\">ψ 80:7</a> + 9 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדְיָנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.18\">Pr 18:18</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדְ֯וָנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.19\">Pr 18:19</a> + 7 times; contracted into <span dir=\"rtl\">מְדָנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.19\">Pr 6:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.12\">10:12</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדֳ֯נִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.14\">Pr 6:14</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדְיְנֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.13\">Pr 19:13</a>.<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>strife, contention</em>, alm. wholly Pr:—<a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.19\">Pr 18:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:29\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.29\">23:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.20\">26:20</a>; also <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.14\">17:14</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רִיב</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.10\">22:10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּין וְקָלוֹן</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ יִשָּׂא</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:3\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.3\">Hb 1:3</a> <em>contention ariseth</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">ריב</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁלּח מ׳</span> <em>let loose strife</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.14\">Pr 6:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.19\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.28\">16:28</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגָרֶה מ׳</span> <em>he stirreth up strife</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.18\">15:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.25\">28:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.22\">29:22</a>; note especially <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ מִדְוָ֯נִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.21\">26:21</a> = <em>a contentious, quarrelsome man;</em> oftener <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵשֶׁת מ׳</span> = <em>a contentious woman</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.9\">21:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.24\">25:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.15\">27:15</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵשֶׁת מ׳ וָכָ֑עַס</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.19\">21:19</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>object of contention</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:7\" href=\"/Psalms.80.7\">ψ 80:7</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ מָדוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.10\">Je 15:10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ רִיב</span>).—On <span dir=\"rtl\">מָדוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.20\">2 S 21:20</a> Qr, v. i. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, מִדָּה\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_מִדָּה\">מִדָּה</a> sub <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, מִדָּה\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_מִדָּה\">מדד</a>.","next":"BDB, מָדוֹן²","prev":"BDB, דָּנִאֵל"}